<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World</p>
<p>Team Cup matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Blue Group</p>
<p>Spain beat Netherlands 2-0</p>
<p>Results (Spanish names first):</p>
<p>Felix Mantilla beat Paul Haarhuis 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Albert Costa beat Jan Siemerink 6-1 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Germany beat Sweden 2-0</p>
<p>Results (German names first):</p>
<p>Michael Stich beat Magnus Gustafsson 2-6 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Martin Sinner beat Magnus Larsson 7-6 (7-4) 7-6 (8-6)</p>
</text>
